<title>FRANCE: Rouen August 1-21 flour exports at 43,624 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Rouen August 1-21 flour exports at 43,624 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rouen flour exports reached 43,624 tonnes between August 1 and August 21, port officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>A total of 69,000 tonnes of flour was shipped from the French port in August 1995.</p>
<p>Destinations (in tonnes)-</p>
<p>    West Africa................800    Estonia...2,461</p>
<p>    Sudan...................20,419    Yemen....19,944</p>
<p>One ship was expected shortly in Rouen to load around 10,000 tonnes of flour. Destination was not specified.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
